# Maps machine-generated .local commit authors (never resolvable to a GitHub
# account) onto the canonical identity, so `git log`/`git shortlog` display
# correctly. Does not rewrite history and does not affect GitHub's own
# contribution-graph attribution (that's controlled by verified account
# emails, not this file).
